END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_imrahil013
"Dol Amroth will not falter this day!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_imrahil014
"Honour your fallen Lord!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_imrahil015
"Courage! Courage for the fallen!"
END


///////////CINE - DOCK/////////////

SCRIPT:mgfotr_guritz001
"Guritz: Late as usual, pirate scum! There's knifework here needs doing!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_guritz002
"Guritz: Come on, you sea-rats! Get off your ships!"
End

SCRIPT:MEMinas_Gimli001
"Gimli: There's plenty for the both of us! May the best Dwarf win!"
End

SCRIPT:mgfotr_aragorn243
"Aragorn: Unfurl the banner of Elendil! Forward, Men of Gondor!"
END

///////////ACT V - DOCK/////////////

SCRIPT:mgfotr_aragorn451
"Make safe the harbour!"
End

///////////CINE - RESCUE/////////////


SCRIPT:mgfotr_aragorn244
"Aragorn: Legolas, what of the White City? Are we too late?"
End

SCRIPT:mgfotr_legolas136
"Legolas: There is great ruin of fire across the field. The Enemy is everywhere and there is heavy fighting in front of the City."
End

SCRIPT:mgfotr_aragorn368
"Aragorn: Then that is where we will go."
End

SCRIPT:mgfotr_halbarad065
"Halbarad: We cannot delay! The Prince of Dol Amroth is greatly outnumbered!"
End

SCRIPT:mgrotk_legolas013
"Legolas: We must find a way across here quickly."
End

SCRIPT:mgfotr_elrohir050
"Elrohir: We must save all that we can!"
End

///////////ACT VI - RESCUE/////////////

SCRIPT:mgfotr_aragorn452
"You are not forsaken, rally to me!"
End

SCRIPT:mgfotr_aragorn453
"We come to Gondor's aid!"
End


///////////CINE - MEETING/////////////

SCRIPT:mgfotr_imrahil004
"Imrahil: Who are you, that has come to our aid so fortuitously? We did not look to \n see any allies come into Harlond this day, let alone beneath black sails."
End

SCRIPT:mgfotr_halbarad039
"Halbarad: This is Aragorn, son of Arathorn. He is the heir of Elendil, and to the Throne of Gondor."
End

SCRIPT:mgfotr_aragorn369
"Aragorn: That will do, Halbarad. I will make no claims before Sauron is defeated."
End

SCRIPT:mgfotr_boromir120
"Boromir: Here is a valiant captain of Men. It is good to see you, Aragorn."
End

SCRIPT:mgfotr_aragorn449
"Aragorn: And you, Boromir."
End

SCRIPT:mgfotr_eomer030
"Eomer: You come none too soon, my friend. Much loss and sorrow has befallen us."
End

SCRIPT:mgfotr_aragorn450
"Aragorn: Then let us avenge it ere we speak of it!"
End

SCRIPT:mgfotr_imrahil005
"Imrahil: So it will be, my Lord Aragorn. We will take the fight to the Enemy!"
End

SCRIPT:mgfotr_imrahil006
"Imrahil: Their host gathers in the south. We must strike at their camp before they regain their strength."
End

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gimli134
"Gimli: Let us be rid of them!"
End

